1311
00:58:44,840 --> 00:58:47,860
But with standard
RLHF, you will--

1312
00:58:47,860 --> 00:58:49,860
if you were doing that
with just helpful only,

1313
00:58:49,860 --> 00:58:52,318
you will start to push that
frontier towards getting higher

1314
00:58:52,318 --> 00:58:53,740
scores on helpfulness.

1315
00:58:53,740 --> 00:58:56,120
And then, if you start
