1347
01:00:13,175 --> 01:00:14,300
via reinforcement learning.

1348
01:00:14,300 --> 01:00:16,120
So this is an active
area of research,

1349
01:00:16,120 --> 01:00:19,880
just trying to get the models
to be better at self-correction

1350
01:00:19,880 --> 01:00:23,560
just beyond just the helpfulness
and harmlessness paradigm.

1351
01:00:23,560 --> 01:00:25,640
So that might be another
set of project ideas

1352
01:00:25,640 --> 01:00:28,500
that you might want to explore.

1353
01:00:28,500 --> 01:00:33,720
So let's recap and then
